00:21:57.068 --> 00:21:59.662
It agrees with the experimental data.

265
00:22:05.708 --> 00:22:10.614
AI orchestrates the whole workflow.

266
00:22:13.246 --> 00:22:16.140
Another one I’ll show you is on GitHub.

