00:22:17.968 --> 00:22:22.324
It is an AI research system
running on your own computer,

268
00:22:23.778 --> 00:22:26.812
with whatever account and API key you choose.

269
00:22:31.378 --> 00:22:38.972
K-Dense AI has created
a remarkable set of skills,

270
00:22:40.328 --> 00:22:43.744
including Scientific Agents
and Science Superpowers.

271
00:22:46.978 --> 00:22:48.812
There are also Lab Instrument MCPs.

272
00:22:49.342 --> 00:22:53.368
There are agent skills you

273
00:22:54.132 --> 00:22:57.108
can find here. You can

274
00:22:58.272 --> 00:23:07.038
integrate them into your harness
by installing the skills. Then the

275
00:23:07.924 --> 00:23:14.718
OpenCode will install the skill set where
your LLM can use the skill set later.

276
00:23:15.598 --> 00:23:17.892
The skill set can always
improve. There can be errors.

277
00:23:18.288 --> 00:23:20.404
I use an AI agent to create

278
00:23:21.114 --> 00:23:24.908
an interactive lecture

279
00:23:28.248 --> 00:23:30.942
And a video like this.

280
00:23:31.758 --> 00:23:36.132
I asked what kind of

281
00:23:36.598 --> 00:23:40.718
free tools would let me

282
00:23:40.748 --> 00:23:46.654
create interactive software that
encourages critical thinking.

283
00:23:48.048 --> 00:23:49.232
It gave us a suggestion.

284
00:23:49.738 --> 00:23:52.842
The SKILL.md is important.

285
00:23:53.614 --> 00:23:54.788
It makes it reusable.

286
00:23:57.852 --> 00:24:00.328
If you’re unhappy with the result,

287
00:24:00.972 --> 00:24:02.428
upgrade the skill.

288
00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:05.878
The skill set becomes more and more powerful.

289
00:24:07.614 --> 00:24:09.148
It's like teaching a genius.

290
00:24:10.092 --> 00:24:11.948
It just gives direction.

291
00:24:12.174 --> 00:24:14.756
If the outcome is not to your satisfaction,

292
00:24:14.786 --> 00:24:17.268
you give it another suggestion or direction.

293
00:24:17.676 --> 00:24:22.030
I also use it to create “AI Agents in STEM,”

294
00:24:22.926 --> 00:24:26.700
a series of 8-10 lectures,

295
00:24:28.716 --> 00:24:32.760
with me talking using a

296
00:24:33.376 --> 00:24:39.420
